# What must never reach a Vercel deployment.
#
# Vercel honours .gitignore for git-based deploys but not for CLI ones, and the
# admin desk is deployed from the CLI. These are the files that would be served
# as static assets if they were ever uploaded.

.env
.env.*
*/.env
*/.env.*
contracts/.env

api/.uploads
api/dist
node_modules
.git
.expo
